Native q4_0/q8_0 K/V dequantization in the llama.cpp FlashAttention MMA tile
loader (sm75 decode and verify). From the Turing campaign: without a source
build, quantized caches are copied to f16 once per layer per step, which
dominated speculative verification. Apply on top of ggml-org/llama.cpp b11050.

Context and measurements: docs/exec-plans/active/llamacpp-parity.md
("Quantized K/V dequant in the MMA tile loader").

Expected use: a source-built llama-cpp package (mainline) on sm75. Not applied
to the prebuilt release in pkgs/llama-cpp-cuda.nix because release binaries
cannot be patched after the fact.

